Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "The dragon knight should be somewhere in this cave. I'll just
have to find him and convince him to join me. Forcibly.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Wait... There's something else here, too...",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Leave while you can, interloper! We've sealed the ring away
where you'll never find it!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Oh, this suddenly got MUCH more interesting.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Now, let's see here... If I were a rock-brained do-gooder,
where would I "seal" away a dangerous artifact...?",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Hmm... No ring here...",
  "1.0.6.0" => "This way is open... I wonder...",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Ah, I feel it... The ring is here! Come out now, darling...",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Ahhh, much better! But who are you and what do you want
with me?",
  "1.0.9.0" => "I've been looking to recruit a general for my army. I believe
you might be the monster for the job.",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Kiya ha ha! I look forward to proving you right!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "I'd also planned to enlist the dragon who lives in these caves.
Unfortunately, he's on the other side of a gate...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Ha! I'll burn down, blast apart, or shatter anything that gets in
your way, Mistress! Heh heh hee!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Mmm. This one seems very interested in proving his loyalty...
Perhaps a bit TOO interested...",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Ah, you must be the dragon, Volga. I offer you a chance to
command and to kill on a scale you can't imagine.",
  "1.0.15.0" => "No. Leave.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "I'm afraid that won't do. Looks like I'll have to get my hands
dirty...",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Leave me be. I have no interest in humans or their wars.",
  "1.0.18.0" => "You don't fool me. You're a warrior. War is the only thing that
interests you.",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Hssss! You not insult Master Volga!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "We k-k-kill her for you, Master!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "We roast her flesh for great feassst!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Good. But don't underestimate her. She has the smell of
power...",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Now we fight, witch!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Little monsters no match for usss! We crush them all!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Rather talkative for lizards... I suppose I'll have to intervene if
I want to keep my army...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "We have to reclaim that ring! If it remains unsealed, there's no
telling what could happen!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "When fighting Gorons, watch for giant rodents. Your base will
thank you for it.",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Interesting. Is it only the two large lizards that can talk?",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Apparently. Let's keep one of them. It might be useful later to
have a translator.",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Bombchu deployed!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "If you enjoy winning battles, you'll definitely want to stop those
Bombchus from getting where they're going.",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Good work! We liberated one of their keeps!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Gorons! Even our enemies help us stop you, witch!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Yes! Just a bit more, brothers!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Pathetic. The enemy takes two keeps and our side is quivering
in fear already.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Keep at it, brothers! We can drive her off!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "No! Our Bombchu!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "That's our last Bombchu! Good luck, little fella!
Wait, huh?",
  "1.0.39.0" => "It's not moving! Is it broken?",
  "1.0.40.0" => "The lizard men seem to be getting stronger. I suppose that's
what I get for being distracted...",
  "1.0.41.0" => "We found witch's ring c-c-creature!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "You not touch the massster!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "All right, little lizards--you want a fight? Let's fight!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Uh, Mistress? I think I may be in a tiny bit of trouble...",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Hmm. You greatly disappoint me, servant. ",
  "1.0.46.0" => "AHHHHH! IT HURTS!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Stop whimpering, cretin! I'm on my way.",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Massster! The witch is...too strong for us!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "I acknowledge your power if you can defeat my brethren.
But I still see no reason to be involved in your war.",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Still? I'll just have to MAKE you serve me!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "So sorry, Master. We shame dragonk-k-kind...",
  "1.0.52.0" => "We mussst call great beasts!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Heh heh heh! If I can make these dragonfolk obey me, I won't
need any sorceress to conquer the human world...",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Am I really being betrayed by evil jewelry? I suppose I should
have expected it, but it's disappointing nonetheless.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Gyahahahahah! Once this keep is crushed, the witch won't
stand a chance against my magic!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Let us understand each other, Volga. If I defeat you, you will
have no choice but to serve me, correct?",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Indeed. And when I defeat you, you'll be forced to leave these
caves forever.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "I will not willingly mingle with humans--but I will take back my
kin's keep!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Gyah! I'll swear any oath you like--I'll never betray you again!
Mercy, please!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "See that you prove your worth to me every hour of every day
or you're back to being an accessory.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "How have I lost...?",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Don't beat yourself up over it--I don't want you to damage my
property, slave.",
  "1.0.63.0" => "This whole exercise has taught me something important:
independent thought is severely overrated in underlings.",
  "1.0.64.0" => "I swear...eternal loyalty...to Cia.",
  "1.0.65.0" => "My...only desire...is to fight worthy foes.",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Excellent. Now that that's done, let's talk about laying siege to
Hyrule Castle...",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Grrr... I have to retreat. I went too easy on the vermin...",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Gyaaaah! I just barely lived!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Nice ring. If only I could add it to my arsenal...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Looks like our side could use a little shoring up! Allow me
to fill the gaps with a few more warm bodies!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Not bad, ring.",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Destroy that Bombchu before it annihilates our base!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "We got the keep back! Now to reseal the ring!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "The Hyrulean soldiers went ahead
without us! Impa, we have to catch up!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "The soldiers are in trouble!
We have to hurry!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Thanks, kid! You really saved our hides!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Here we are! And Impa is right behind us,
so don't worry!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "There must be a keep around here that's
spawning monsters... We should capture it!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "That's got to be the monsters' lair!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "We did it, but it looks like monsters are still
coming from another keep... Keep looking!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Please, we need help! Quick!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Oh no... I'm so sorry...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Thank you! Now, why don't we let the
Bombchu do the hard part!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "We have to guard the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Link! Defeat all the enemies on the way to the spire
to give the Bombchu a clear shot at blowing it up!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Uh-oh! Link can't get to that keep...
It's all up to you, Impa!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "We weren't able to stop the monsters from 
coming!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "We should've taken that monster keep first.
There are just too many monsters...",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Phew! Now the Bombchu can reach the stone spires!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Thank you, Impa! Let's keep going!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "No! They destroyed the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "We need that Bombchu to get out of the caves
and find Princess Zelda... What will we do...?",
  "13.0.21.0" => "Impa, please come quick!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "The South Gate of this keep leads to the exit.
If we capture the keep, the gate might open!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Oh? The South Gate didn't open...
At least we captured the keep!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Enemies are coming out of the tunnels!
Maybe the Spirit of the Caves is in there...",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Link can take that keep! He won't give up,
no matter what!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "That ghostly guy is really suspicious...
He must be the Spirit of the Caves!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "I knew you could do it, Impa!
Now we can all get out of the caves!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "The boy covering our flank has fallen.
If we do nothing, we'll be surrounded!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "Drat, more stones in our way!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "Good answer! We've got the Bombchu right 
here!",
  "13.0.31.0" => "We can't launch the Bombchu with enemies in
the keep. Quick, take it back!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Impa, we need another Bombchu! Link can
defend the Gorons while you search!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "Impa! Can you please clear that keep out?
If you do, we can use the Bombchu!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Everyone set? Then here we go!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "Hey...uh...ninja person! We'll be out in
no time! Just come with us!",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Great! That's one out of two!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Great, now we can get to the exit!
Thanks a lot, everyone!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "Great, now we can head into Faron Woods and
find this woman we've been hearing about!",
  "13.0.39.0" => "I hope she's Princess Zelda...",
  "13.0.40.0" => "Link, get a grip! Without the Hero, this world is
doomed...",
  "13.0.41.0" => "We can't move ahead if the stone is still here...
We should go back and rethink our strategy.",
  "13.0.42.0" => "I can hear our soldiers up ahead! But the
gates are closed, so we can't join them...",
  "13.0.43.0" => "Impa! I think there's something suspicious
down there in the caves!",
  "13.0.44.0" => "Could we do something to open the way
ahead...?",
  "13.0.45.0" => "Hey, that wall looks a bit cracked!
Maybe we can use something to destroy it...",
  "13.0.46.0" => "Hurry up, Link! The exit is here!",
  "13.0.47.0" => "Impa, are you all right? We'll be waiting at
the exit!",
  "13.0.48.0" => "Should we have taken control of the
monsters' keeps first?",
}